      "team": "全国",
      "outlet": "MLB Pipeline",
      "text": "Peoria — made up of prospects from the Padres, Mariners, Orioles, Reds and Cardinals systems — won the AFL championship tonight. Jesse Borek has the details: www.mlb.com/milb/news/20...",
      "likes": 6,
      "reposts": 1,
