      "jp_players": [],
      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "Tough night for the Royals prospects. Lamkin had three errors behind him and threw a wild pitch to get roughed up for five in two innings, and Rose (who did walk twice) grounded into a rally-ending double play. Still, fun season!",
